    <description>Prevent Duplicate Contacts
•	Problem:
When a user creates a new Contact, check if another Contact already exists with the same Email.
o	If duplicate exists → Don’t allow save + show an error message.
o	If no duplicate → Allow creation.
•	Twist: Implement using a Before-Save Flow for performance.
•	Flow Type: Record-Triggered Flow (Contact, before save).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Prevent Duplicate Contacts {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Prevent Duplicate Contacts</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
